<title>USA: Village Super Market Q4 shr up to $0.21.</title>
<headline>Village Super Market Q4 shr up to $0.21.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, N.J. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>7/27/96			7/29/95</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.21		    $0.12</p>
<p> Net			    617			352</p>
<p> Sales		    174,892		  173,699</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.69		    $0.20</p>
<p> Net			  2,006			578</p>
<p> Sales		    688,632		  677,322</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) Full company name is Village Super Market Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said in a statement the increase in fourth quarter net income was mostly the result of improved gross margin percentages and lower coupon costs.</p>
<p>The company said fiscal 1996 results include a gain on the sale of real estate of $0.20 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
